@prefix : <https://example.org/business/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
:Order a owl:Class .
:PaidOrder a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf :Order .
:tenant a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:region a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
:paidAt a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
:netCents a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:range xsd:integer .
